### Create a sales invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales_invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "cashbox_id": 1,
  "cashbox_account_id": 1,
  "shift_id": 1,
  "inventory_id": 1,
  "year": 2026,
  "client_id": 1,
  "discount": 0,
  "grand_total": 5000,
  "sub_total": 5000,
  "discounted_total": 5000
}

### Get a sales invoice by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales_invoices/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List sales invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales_invoices?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
